   6:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *          This file provides firmware functions to manage the following
   7:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *          functionalities of the Timer Extended peripheral:
   8:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *           + Time Hall Sensor Interface Initialization
