  13:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *           + Time OCRef clear configuration
  14:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *           + Timer remapping capabilities configuration
