1760:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****     This section provides functions allowing to:
1761:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****       (+) Configure the commutation event in case of use of the Hall sensor interface.
1762:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****       (+) Configure Output channels for OC and PWM mode.
1763:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_tim_ex.c **** 
1764:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****       (+) Configure Complementary channels, break features and dead time.
1765:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****       (+) Configure Master synchronization.
1766:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****       (+) Configure timer remapping capabilities.
